From f13fde0833edd9037c8627cb3c73b6d374b30191 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:04:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Fix map: give Ground TileMapLayer a TileSet source so
 painted tiles show in the 2D editor

The Ground layer had 3651 tiles painted against TileSet source id 6, but the
TileSet was empty (no atlas source), so nothing rendered. Add a TileSetAtlasSource
at id 6 backed by a placeholder 16x16 atlas (assets/tiles/ground_placeholder.png).
Swap the texture for the real tileset art if you have it.
