From 07b0ae4130ffb0c493e89f9da4ae3cc117df0687 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:38:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Move map and lobby art out of scripts and into scene
 nodes

match.tscn: DiningTable position + visuals (Aura, TableTop), spawn markers and a
Workbench (Area2D with ColorRect/Polygon2D/Label children) are now real nodes.
lobby_room.tscn: room floor, floorboards, walls, rug, shelf, vending machine,
contract board, emblem drawer, door and labels are nodes under Decor; interaction
spots follow those nodes. Scripts keep only dynamic drawing (party slots, hero,
prompt, food bar). Adds the imported placeholder tile atlas .import file.
